{'symbol': 'TER', 'date': '2022-11-15 16:05:00', 'title': 'TERADYNE ANNOUNCES CEO SUCCESSION', 'text': 'NORTH READING, MASS., NOV. 15, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE TERADYNE (NASDAQ: TER) BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY NAMED GREGORY SMITH TO SUCCEED MARK E. JAGIELA AS CEO EFFECTIVE FEBRUARY 1, 2023. MR. SMITH WILL JOIN THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS ON THE SAME DATE.'}